---
import { SERVICE_PILLARS, PRECONFIGURED_SYSTEMS } from '../../data/pillars';
---

<section id="pilares" class="bg-slate-50 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-dark">
        Catálogo Oficial Modular
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark sm:text-4xl">
        Cuatro pilares técnicos para destrabar ventas y ordenar tu operación
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
        Elegí resolver primero el área que hoy te cuesta más dinero o tiempo. Todas las piezas se construyen listas para conectarse entre sí.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grilla 2x2 de los 4 Pilares -->
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:mt-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-8">
      {
        SERVICE_PILLARS.map((pillar) => (
          <article class="card-light flex flex-col justify-between p-6 sm:p-8">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-dark font-mono text-xs font-bold text-brand-cyan">
                    {pillar.number}
                  </span>
                  <span class="rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-brand-accent">
                    {pillar.roleBadge}
                  </span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
                  {pillar.codeRange}
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark sm:text-2xl">
                {pillar.title}
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base">
                {pillar.painSolved}
              </p>

              <div class="mt-5 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
                <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">
                  Qué programamos e instalamos:
                </p>
                <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
                  {pillar.whatWeInstall.map((bullet) => (
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                      <span class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-accent" aria-hidden="true" />
                      <span>{bullet}</span>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
              <div>
                <span class="inline-block rounded-md bg-brand-dark/5 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-dark">
                  ⏱ {pillar.timeframeLabel}
                </span>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">{pillar.timeframeDetail}</p>
              </div>

              <a
                href="#contacto"
                data-select-pain={pillar.painSelectValue}
                data-cta-origin={`pilar_${pillar.number}`}
                class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 font-display text-xs font-bold text-brand-accent transition-colors hover:text-brand-dark sm:text-sm"
              >
                <span>{pillar.ctaLabel}</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <!-- Paquetes Integrados ("Sistemas") con Bonificación 15%-20% -->
    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:mt-12 sm:p-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent">
            Paquetes Preconfigurados (“Sistemas”)
          </span>
          <h3 class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-dark sm:text-xl">
            ¿Querés resolver un área completa de una sola vez? Accedés a un 15% a 20% de bonificación.
          </h3>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#contacto"
          data-cta-origin="sistemas_paquetes"
          class="btn-secondary-light shrink-0 !py-2.5 !px-4 !text-xs sm:!text-sm"
        >
          Consultar qué paquete aplica a mi empresa →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {
          PRECONFIGURED_SYSTEMS.map((sys) => (
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/70 p-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-accent">
                {sys.modules}
              </span>
              <h4 class="mt-1 font-display text-sm font-bold text-brand-dark">
                {sys.name}
              </h4>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                {sys.summary}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
